            "paragraph": "The NASA Goddard Earth Observing System (GEOS) implements two aerosol schemes to interactively calculate the evolution of aerosol and gaseous tracers. Both include parameterized representation of aerosol formation, growth, aging and wet removal, and differ in their treatment of the ASD and mixing state. GOCART (Chin et al., 2000; Colarco et al., 2010a) is used operationally on weather forecast and data assimilation applications.",
